[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 7682.47, "timestamp": "02:08:02", "text": "确切地。但现在，现在我的想法是，“哦，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7685.79, "timestamp": "02:08:05", "text": "只有100米"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7689.669, "timestamp": "02:08:09", "text": "Mbps。”它只有100 Mbps。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7692.39, "timestamp": "02:08:12", "text": "等等，连GB都不到。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7695.43, "timestamp": "02:08:15", "text": "等等，你目前的计划是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7699.55, "timestamp": "02:08:19", "text": "呃，目前我有四个呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7702.95, "timestamp": "02:08:22", "text": "41. 我之前有一台100的，但我把它处理掉了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7705.43, "timestamp": "02:08:25", "text": "它。但我现在又要去拿它了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7707.75, "timestamp": "02:08:27", "text": "再次因为我真的以为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7711.35, "timestamp": "02:08:31", "text": "他说，我叔叔付的钱太多了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7713.75, "timestamp": "02:08:33", "text": "比如，我去，你为什么跟我一样？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7716.229, "timestamp": "02:08:36", "text": "拿到上层方案了吗？我当时就想，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7720.39, "timestamp": "02:08:40", "text": "因为我经常下载东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7724.149, "timestamp": "02:08:44", "text": "他说，不，你只要选择40计划就行了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7726.39, "timestamp": "02:08:46", "text": "于是，我照做了。显然我遇到了瓶颈。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 7739.669, "timestamp": "02:08:59", "text": "我用的是Gio的30MB1套餐，也就是第一个套餐。"}]